m/a/ZfJ7e4W", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ithuki26/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c47abb47/uploads/origins/71217ce8-da1b-4dd1-b206-405b39aeffc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bfa56209d230031026d521caa76a7e3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c47abb47/uploads/origins/71217ce8-da1b-4dd1-b206-405b39aeffc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bfa56209d230031026d521caa76a7e3, https://si.imgix.net/c47abb47/uploads/origins/71217ce8-da1b-4dd1-b206-405b39aeffc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2720936884f714bc7b6aeb210ad80ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c47abb47/uploads/origins/71217ce8-da1b-4dd1-b206-405b39aeffc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a958a52d3ad9fd90dc08165f4089b3e0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really love your artworks especially your drawings of Lazward, Marx and Peri! FE: IF is my favorite game!\nI would like to request five chibis drawn in your super cute chibi style here: https://www.foriio.com/works/682295\nI would like it if you could draw my vtuber character: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rK5d79jBFWPeCfjCK7I7jGmcC4AYvn7I?usp=sharing \nThe character's hobbies is drawing, taking naps and having fun. The character likes to eat curry and listen to wind chimes during the summer. \nI will leave the poses and expressions up to you, please have fun with the drawing. If possible I would like to suggest: \n1) Drawing \n2) Drinking cream soda\n3) Napping\n4) Singing\n5) Crying on the floor\n\nThank you for all your hard work! IF possible, I would like to use these chibis for my streams on Twitch, Youtube and other social media. I would also like to have these chibis with a transparent background so I can use them separately. Thank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ithuki26/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6aef74730eccf35748acc48a6d2a886f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6aef74730eccf35748acc48a6d2a886f, https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa40bd19387bb37a41a210f58630ff27 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1f6999a527198b1213355d341ec11e7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "セリアは木刀を持っていて、ウアサックは魔法の杖を持っている！セリアは木刀を持っていて、ウアタックは魔法の杖を持っているのですが、この2人のアイテムが壊れてしまったので、修理に出すお金がいくらあるのか、お金袋を調べます。二人の慌てた表情をどうぞ！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/TLZz6xW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ithuki26/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef8bdd45/uploads/origins/69bdc58f-7791-4d7a-9560-bd3b683ea111?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53be9812e966de77b206569d9dd15f5a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ef8bdd45/uploads/origins/69bdc58f-7791-4d7a-9560-bd3b683ea111?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53be9812e966de77b206569d9dd15f5a, https://si.imgix.net/ef8bdd45/uploads/origins/69bdc58f-7791-4d7a-9560-bd3b683ea111?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da6262d62849410f95fa293801bcb897 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ef8bdd45/uploads/origins/69bdc58f-7791-4d7a-9560-bd3b683ea111?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd91783e938c315097884cbc3884deb8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "樹さん、こんにちは。いつもお世話になっております。\n今回、Skebを始められたとのことで、ぜひリクエストしたくメッセージを送らせて頂きます。\n\n今回描いて頂きたいのは、自宅創作のキャラクター、シエル（薄紅の髪をした少年）とルア(金髪ポニーテールの女の子)です。シエルは少し神経質ですが真面目な少年で、ルアは温厚で頑張りやな少女で、両想いのような関係です。\n自筆なので拙い部分も多々ありますが、参考に設定資料用のリンクを貼り付けています。\n\n構図としては、二人で一冊の分厚い本を読みながら何か話し合っている様子……みたいな感じです。おおざっぱで申し訳ないですが、細かな部分はお任せします。\n\n内容やお値段をご確認頂いた上、大丈夫そうであれば、ぜひよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/i/events/1217061389258260480?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}